{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/93825cf459cd7252f2c6d350789e9838.poster.avif?t=1759492290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/93825cf459cd7252f2c6d350789e9838.webm?t=1759492290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/93825cf459cd7252f2c6d350789e9838.mp4?t=1759492290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/ead1bc31407ddd1653860aa7388961e8.avif?t=1759492290\" alt=\"Deco header: What if color wasn&#039;t just part of the world... But the key to solving it?\" width=1560 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorami is a co-op puzzle platformer where every color holds meaning, every step poses a question, and every solved puzzle brings you deeper into a mysterious, spirited world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't need fast reflexes here. This is a journey of logic, experimentation, and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The demo version contains a selection of levels to be experienced in local co-op only.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/450810997001e753c613a3245cc60f60.avif?t=1759492290\" alt=\"Deco header: A World Built On Color\" width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colors define the rules of reality.\u00a0By shifting your character\u2019s color alignment, you can manipulate how you interact with the environment in surprising and satisfying ways. Each puzzle is a small ecosystem, designed to be explored, understood, and solved at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/c479425eb7f697abfc071b50e993a5fe.poster.avif?t=1759492290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/c479425eb7f697abfc071b50e993a5fe.webm?t=1759492290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/c479425eb7f697abfc071b50e993a5fe.mp4?t=1759492290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/e9658626e68457bbe74aa6e63c4b0f1d.avif?t=1759492290\" alt=\"Deco header: Two Minds Painting Together\" width=1560 height=124 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorami was created to be explored together. In a local or online co-op, two players work side by side to navigate the world, each with their own ideas, perspective, and role in the puzzle solving process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/bc0c7da63268938b1350b3ed260f80f7.poster.avif?t=1759492290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/bc0c7da63268938b1350b3ed260f80f7.webm?t=1759492290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/bc0c7da63268938b1350b3ed260f80f7.mp4?t=1759492290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/016dd8a78e94ff66e41d19a0866ffd76.avif?t=1759492290\" alt=\"Deco header: Asymmetric Puzzle Design\" width=1560 height=122 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need someone to open a path while you're standing on a moving platform?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our levels are designed for complementary problem solving, and each player can use color independently. One player can manipulate platforms while the other moves through a newly opened area. Or they can carry color between distant parts of the map. Coordination is the key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/ab4c783870e9a27d3115cd4091d33f0e.poster.avif?t=1759492290\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/ab4c783870e9a27d3115cd4091d33f0e.apng?t=1759492290\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Spirit 1 jumping with joy\" width=144 height=192 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/45a1c5707901d241b6d21d3e86c80217.poster.avif?t=1759492290\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/45a1c5707901d241b6d21d3e86c80217.apng?t=1759492290\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Spirit 2 jumping with joy\" width=144 height=192 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001780?t=1759492290","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/6cf9efe84930cf3997c3c8cac7cc922577dc3422/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759492290","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/26f7677c4f8eee3545958d43f62d641efa39fbdc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759492290","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/26f7677c4f8eee3545958d43f62d641efa39fbdc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759492290","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4022340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >local 2-player co-op - available in our demo and the full game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >online 2-player co-op - <strong>coming in the full version</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >full Xbox and PlayStation controller support,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >single screen levels with\u00a0beautiful hand drawn 2D pixel art,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >non-punishing gameplay - you can restart the current level any time.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/93825cf459cd7252f2c6d350789e9838.poster.avif?t=1759492290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/93825cf459cd7252f2c6d350789e9838.webm?t=1759492290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/93825cf459cd7252f2c6d350789e9838.mp4?t=1759492290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/ead1bc31407ddd1653860aa7388961e8.avif?t=1759492290\" alt=\"Deco header: What if color wasn&#039;t just part of the world... But the key to solving it?\" width=1560 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorami is a co-op puzzle platformer where every color holds meaning, every step poses a question, and every solved puzzle brings you deeper into a mysterious, spirited world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't need fast reflexes here. This is a journey of logic, experimentation, and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The demo version contains a selection of levels to be experienced in local co-op only.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/450810997001e753c613a3245cc60f60.avif?t=1759492290\" alt=\"Deco header: A World Built On Color\" width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colors define the rules of reality.\u00a0By shifting your character\u2019s color alignment, you can manipulate how you interact with the environment in surprising and satisfying ways. Each puzzle is a small ecosystem, designed to be explored, understood, and solved at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/c479425eb7f697abfc071b50e993a5fe.poster.avif?t=1759492290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/c479425eb7f697abfc071b50e993a5fe.webm?t=1759492290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/c479425eb7f697abfc071b50e993a5fe.mp4?t=1759492290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/e9658626e68457bbe74aa6e63c4b0f1d.avif?t=1759492290\" alt=\"Deco header: Two Minds Painting Together\" width=1560 height=124 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorami was created to be explored together. In a local or online co-op, two players work side by side to navigate the world, each with their own ideas, perspective, and role in the puzzle solving process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/bc0c7da63268938b1350b3ed260f80f7.poster.avif?t=1759492290\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/bc0c7da63268938b1350b3ed260f80f7.webm?t=1759492290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/bc0c7da63268938b1350b3ed260f80f7.mp4?t=1759492290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/016dd8a78e94ff66e41d19a0866ffd76.avif?t=1759492290\" alt=\"Deco header: Asymmetric Puzzle Design\" width=1560 height=122 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need someone to open a path while you're standing on a moving platform?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our levels are designed for complementary problem solving, and each player can use color independently. One player can manipulate platforms while the other moves through a newly opened area. Or they can carry color between distant parts of the map. Coordination is the key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/ab4c783870e9a27d3115cd4091d33f0e.poster.avif?t=1759492290\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/ab4c783870e9a27d3115cd4091d33f0e.apng?t=1759492290\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Spirit 1 jumping with joy\" width=144 height=192 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/45a1c5707901d241b6d21d3e86c80217.poster.avif?t=1759492290\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/extras/45a1c5707901d241b6d21d3e86c80217.apng?t=1759492290\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Spirit 2 jumping with joy\" width=144 height=192 /></picture></span></p>","developers":["Gryfyard"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001780/fa54a2eda4187af00ac414e0aefd045c92361da5/header.jpg?t=1759492290","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4001780/1628936812/3c6b6723f4413fa39d407d4529ccea832be25f85/1759147522/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759147915","dash_h264":"h